{"id":"04aa1148d91b88f8","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-tmcomp.md","title":"配置、单步计算与输出","display":"df-tmcomp — 配置、单步计算与输出","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-tmcomp","aliases":["20-df-tmcomp"],"display":"df-tmcomp — 配置、单步计算与输出","chapter":"1","section":"1.4","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"Definitions 1.4.2–1.4.3；本地配置关系展开","source_pdf_pages":[44,45],"source_printed_pages":[8,9],"depends_on":["[[20-df-tm]]","[[20-df-partial-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-tmcomp"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-tmcomp</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-tmcomp — 配置、单步计算与输出"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"section","html":"1.4"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definitions 1.4.2–1.4.3；本地配置关系展开"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>44</span><span>45</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>8</span><span>9</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"514101784b6fa26f\" href=\"?note=514101784b6fa26f\" title=\"20-df-tm\">20-df-tm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3f7915f8f8ad037c\" href=\"?note=3f7915f8f8ad037c\" title=\"20-df-partial-function\">20-df-partial-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,S,\\delta,1,0)\\in\\mathcal M\">\\(M=(Q,S,\\delta,1,0)\\in\\mathcal M\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\omega\">\\(x,y\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c=(q,t,h)\">\\(c=(q,t,h)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t:\\mathbb Z\\to S\">\\(t:\\mathbb Z\\to S\\)</span> 仅有限多个非空白格。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"514101784b6fa26f\" href=\"?note=514101784b6fa26f\" title=\"20-df-tm\">20-df-tm</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3f7915f8f8ad037c\" href=\"?note=3f7915f8f8ad037c\" title=\"20-df-partial-function\">20-df-partial-function</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\omega\">\\(k\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\\in\\omega^k\">\\(\\vec x\\in\\omega^k\\)</span>；停止历史的配置变量均在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Conf}_M\">\\(\\operatorname{Conf}_M\\)</span> 内量化，磁带坐标在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb Z\">\\(\\mathbb Z\\)</span> 内量化。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M(\\vec x)\">\\(M(\\vec x)\\)</span> 使用下述 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 元输入配置。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tmcomp}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Conf}_M:=Q\\times\\{t\\in S^{\\mathbb Z}:|\\{i:t(i)\\ne\\sqcup\\}|&lt;\\omega\\}\\times\\mathbb Z,\\\\\n(q,t,h)\\to_M(q&#39;,t&#39;,h&#39;)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists b\\in S\\ \\exists d\\in\\{-1,1\\}\\bigl[\\delta(q,t(h))\\downarrow=(q&#39;,b,d)\\land\nh&#39;=h+d\\land t&#39;(h)=b\\land\\forall i\\ne h\\ t&#39;(i)=t(i)\\bigr],\\\\\nt_x(i):=\\begin{cases}1&amp;0\\le i\\le x,\\\\\\sqcup&amp;i&lt;0\\lor i&gt;x,\\end{cases}\\qquad c_0(x):=(1,t_x,0),\\\\\nM(x)\\downarrow=y\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists n\\ \\exists(c_i)_{i\\le n}\\ \\exists t,h\\bigl[c_0=c_0(x)\\land(\\forall i&lt;n\\ c_i\\to_M c_{i+1})\\land\nc_n=(0,t,h)\\land y=|\\{j\\in\\mathbb Z:t(j)=1\\}|\\bigr].\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tmcomp}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Conf}_M:=Q\\times\\{t\\in S^{\\mathbb Z}:|\\{i:t(i)\\ne\\sqcup\\}|&lt;\\omega\\}\\times\\mathbb Z,\\\\\n(q,t,h)\\to_M(q&#39;,t&#39;,h&#39;)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists b\\in S\\ \\exists d\\in\\{-1,1\\}\\bigl[\\delta(q,t(h))\\downarrow=(q&#39;,b,d)\\land\nh&#39;=h+d\\land t&#39;(h)=b\\land\\forall i\\ne h\\ t&#39;(i)=t(i)\\bigr],\\\\\nt_x(i):=\\begin{cases}1&amp;0\\le i\\le x,\\\\\\sqcup&amp;i&lt;0\\lor i&gt;x,\\end{cases}\\qquad c_0(x):=(1,t_x,0),\\\\\nM(x)\\downarrow=y\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists n\\ \\exists(c_i)_{i\\le n}\\ \\exists t,h\\bigl[c_0=c_0(x)\\land(\\forall i&lt;n\\ c_i\\to_M c_{i+1})\\land\nc_n=(0,t,h)\\land y=|\\{j\\in\\mathbb Z:t(j)=1\\}|\\bigr].\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\nb_i(\\vec x):=\\sum_{j&lt;i}(x_j+2)\\quad(i&lt;k),\\\\\nt_{\\vec x}(z):=\\begin{cases}1&amp;\\exists i&lt;k\\ [b_i(\\vec x)\\le z\\le b_i(\\vec x)+x_i],\\\\\n\\sqcup&amp;\\neg\\exists i&lt;k\\ [b_i(\\vec x)\\le z\\le b_i(\\vec x)+x_i],\\end{cases}\\\\\nc_0^{(k)}(\\vec x):=(1,t_{\\vec x},0),\\\\\nM^{(k)}(\\vec x)\\downarrow=y\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\ \\exists c\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_M^{n+1}\\ \\exists t\\in S^{\\mathbb Z}\\ \\exists h\\in\\mathbb Z\\\n[c(0)=c_0^{(k)}(\\vec x)\\land\\forall i&lt;n\\ (c(i)\\to_Mc(i+1))\n\\land c(n)=(0,t,h)\\land y=|\\{z\\in\\mathbb Z:t(z)=1\\}|],\\\\\nM(\\vec x)\\simeq M^{(k)}(\\vec x),\\qquad c_0^{(1)}((x))=c_0(x).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\nb_i(\\vec x):=\\sum_{j&lt;i}(x_j+2)\\quad(i&lt;k),\\\\\nt_{\\vec x}(z):=\\begin{cases}1&amp;\\exists i&lt;k\\ [b_i(\\vec x)\\le z\\le b_i(\\vec x)+x_i],\\\\\n\\sqcup&amp;\\neg\\exists i&lt;k\\ [b_i(\\vec x)\\le z\\le b_i(\\vec x)+x_i],\\end{cases}\\\\\nc_0^{(k)}(\\vec x):=(1,t_{\\vec x},0),\\\\\nM^{(k)}(\\vec x)\\downarrow=y\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\ \\exists c\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_M^{n+1}\\ \\exists t\\in S^{\\mathbb Z}\\ \\exists h\\in\\mathbb Z\\\n[c(0)=c_0^{(k)}(\\vec x)\\land\\forall i&lt;n\\ (c(i)\\to_Mc(i+1))\n\\land c(n)=(0,t,h)\\land y=|\\{z\\in\\mathbb Z:t(z)=1\\}|],\\\\\nM(\\vec x)\\simeq M^{(k)}(\\vec x),\\qquad c_0^{(1)}((x))=c_0(x).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书输出为停止配置整条磁带上 1 的总数，允许输出 0，也不要求读头停在 1 上。有限支撑保证该数有限；转移确定性保证每个输入至多一个输出。原书 (1.1) 的加三机器停在空白格上，旧“头下连续块减一”条件会错误地判它发散，故按原书恢复输出规则。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 元输入以空白分隔各个一元块；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=0\">\\(k=0\\)</span> 允许常数程序。</p>\n<p>来源：Definitions 1.4.2–1.4.3；本地配置关系展开；印刷页 8, 9；PDF 第 44, 45 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-tm","status":"resolved","id":"514101784b6fa26f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-tm]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"3f7915f8f8ad037c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-partial-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-tm","status":"resolved","id":"514101784b6fa26f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-tm]]；see [[20-df-partial-function]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"3f7915f8f8ad037c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-tm]]；see [[20-df-partial-function]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M=(Q,S,\\delta,1,0)\\in\\mathcal M","display":false},{"tex":"x,y\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"c=(q,t,h)","display":false},{"tex":"t:\\mathbb Z\\to S","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x\\in\\omega^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Conf}_M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb Z","display":false},{"tex":"M(\\vec x)","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tmcomp}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Conf}_M:=Q\\times\\{t\\in S^{\\mathbb Z}:|\\{i:t(i)\\ne\\sqcup\\}|<\\omega\\}\\times\\mathbb Z,\\\\\n(q,t,h)\\to_M(q',t',h')\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists b\\in S\\ \\exists d\\in\\{-1,1\\}\\bigl[\\delta(q,t(h))\\downarrow=(q',b,d)\\land\nh'=h+d\\land t'(h)=b\\land\\forall i\\ne h\\ t'(i)=t(i)\\bigr],\\\\\nt_x(i):=\\begin{cases}1&0\\le i\\le x,\\\\\\sqcup&i<0\\lor i>x,\\end{cases}\\qquad c_0(x):=(1,t_x,0),\\\\\nM(x)\\downarrow=y\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists n\\ \\exists(c_i)_{i\\le n}\\ \\exists t,h\\bigl[c_0=c_0(x)\\land(\\forall i<n\\ c_i\\to_M c_{i+1})\\land\nc_n=(0,t,h)\\land y=|\\{j\\in\\mathbb Z:t(j)=1\\}|\\bigr].\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\nb_i(\\vec x):=\\sum_{j<i}(x_j+2)\\quad(i<k),\\\\\nt_{\\vec x}(z):=\\begin{cases}1&\\exists i<k\\ [b_i(\\vec x)\\le z\\le b_i(\\vec x)+x_i],\\\\\n\\sqcup&\\neg\\exists i<k\\ [b_i(\\vec x)\\le z\\le b_i(\\vec x)+x_i],\\end{cases}\\\\\nc_0^{(k)}(\\vec x):=(1,t_{\\vec x},0),\\\\\nM^{(k)}(\\vec x)\\downarrow=y\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\ \\exists c\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_M^{n+1}\\ \\exists t\\in S^{\\mathbb Z}\\ \\exists h\\in\\mathbb Z\\\n[c(0)=c_0^{(k)}(\\vec x)\\land\\forall i<n\\ (c(i)\\to_Mc(i+1))\n\\land c(n)=(0,t,h)\\land y=|\\{z\\in\\mathbb Z:t(z)=1\\}|],\\\\\nM(\\vec x)\\simeq M^{(k)}(\\vec x),\\qquad c_0^{(1)}((x))=c_0(x).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"k=0","display":false}],"bytes":2788,"backlinks":[{"id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-tmcomp]]；see [[20-df-partial-function]]。"},{"id":"2af550cdf8ea0be2","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-tmcomp]]；see [[20-df-characteristic]]。"},{"id":"140cce30ee9c16d1","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-tmcomp]]；see [[20-df-characteristic]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。"},{"id":"4ef1aee16db6b308","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-tmcomp]]。"},{"id":"1b27c625bb944c27","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-tmcomp]]。"},{"id":"d11732572066c4e5","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-tmcomp]]。"},{"id":"d85c7ced66d7ccee","anchor":"ref-47","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-tmcomp]]"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-tmcomp]] — 章 1；直接提供者 2 个。"},{"id":"226855fedac0ee1c","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"新增直接依赖：[[20-df-characteristic]]；[[20-df-pairing]]；[[20-df-tmcomp]]"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-tmcomp]]"},{"id":"15cf85fd84eaf3f9","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"重点入口：编码与模型 [[20-df-strings]]、[[20-df-tmcomp]]、[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]；对象与接口 [[20-df-tred]]、[[20-df-characteristic]]、[[20-df-uniform-matrix]]；逻辑 [[20-df-formula]]、[[20-df-classical-proof-system]]、[[20-df-pa]]；树与构造 [[20-df-splitting-procedure]]、[[20-thm-closed-class-tree-equivalence]]；博弈 [[20-df-gale-stewart]]、[[20-df-bm-strategy]]；良基递归 [[20-df-kleene-O]]、[[20-df-hyp-hierarchy]]。"}],"outgoing":["514101784b6fa26f","3f7915f8f8ad037c"]}